MODULE: ResolvedStagingWrongLog
TARGET: StageOwned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A subscriber stages a physical log other than the one it is tailing
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
          /\ stagedOwner' = IF ~resolved THEN tail ELSE stagedOwner
--- REPLACE
          /\ stagedOwner' = IF ~resolved THEN 3-tail ELSE stagedOwner
--- END
